{"id":"msg_m_ex_mmr_03","cat":"messenger","group":{"id":"room_mmr","label":"M.M.R. · Group"},"label":"3. No. 7, Mana.","stage":null,"prev":"msg_m_ex_mmr_02","next":"msg_m_ex_mmr_04","speakers":{"ether":"Ether","mana":"Mana"},"icons":{"ether":"si_c291_00_s","mana":"si_c290_00_s"},"lines":[{"id":"m_ex_mmr_03_1","type":"Speech","speaker":"ether","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mmr_03_1","text":"No. 7, Mana.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mmr_03_2","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mmr_03_2","text":"Yes?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mmr_03_3","type":"Speech","speaker":"mana","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mmr_03_3","text":"What is it?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mmr_03_4","type":"Speech","speaker":"ether","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mmr_03_4","text":"Are either of you hungry?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mmr_03_5","type":"Speech","speaker":"mana","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mmr_03_5","text":"?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mmr_03_6","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mmr_03_6","text":"Right now?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mmr_03_7","type":"Speech","speaker":"ether","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mmr_03_7","text":"Yes.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mmr_03_8","type":"Speech","speaker":"ether","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mmr_03_8","text":"Right now.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mmr_03_9","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mmr_03_9","text":"Why are you asking that all of a sudden?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mmr_03_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"ether","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mmr_03_10","text":"Because I'm hungry :)","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mmr_03_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"ether","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mmr_03_11","text":"Aren't you famished too, Mana?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mmr_03_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"ether","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mmr_03_12","text":"You've had your nose to the grindstone since yesterday","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mmr_03_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"ether","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mmr_03_13","text":"and you haven't had a chance to eat anything.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mmr_03_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"ether","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mmr_03_14","text":"Even if you're a Nikke, going for so long without food","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mmr_03_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"ether","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mmr_03_15","text":"isn't good for your mental health.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mmr_03_16","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mmr_03_16","text":"What's been keeping you so busy that you haven't been able to eat?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mmr_03_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"ether","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mmr_03_17","text":"The same story as with all working people.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mmr_03_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"ether","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mmr_03_18","text":"Impromptu visits from the higher-ups.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mmr_03_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"ether","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mmr_03_19","text":"Impromptu meetings being scheduled.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mmr_03_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"ether","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mmr_03_20","text":"Impromptu demands of us turning in research reports.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mmr_03_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"mana","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mmr_03_21","text":"Ether.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mmr_03_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"mana","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mmr_03_22","text":"I think it would be best if you stopped talking.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mmr_03_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"ether","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mmr_03_23","text":"Hehe, you're probably right.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mmr_03_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"ether","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mmr_03_24","text":"I like venting to No. 7 so much that","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mmr_03_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"ether","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mmr_03_25","text":"I nearly badmouthed my boss!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mmr_03_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"ether","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mmr_03_26","text":"You truly are an exceptional individual, No. 7.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mmr_03_27","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mmr_03_27","text":"I think you just wanted to let off some steam.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mmr_03_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"ether","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mmr_03_28","text":"Ha, you think so?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mmr_03_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"ether","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mmr_03_29","text":"Anyway, do either of you want to go eat something?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mmr_03_30","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mmr_03_30","text":"Why don't we get whatever it is you want?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mmr_03_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"ether","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mmr_03_31","text":"That's kind of you,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mmr_03_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"ether","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mmr_03_32","text":"but I'm too lazy to think right now, so I thought I'd ask you all instead.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mmr_03_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"mana","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mmr_03_33","text":"I figured as much.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mmr_03_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"mana","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mmr_03_34","text":"I'm exhausted.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mmr_03_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"mana","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mmr_03_35","text":"The only thing I want right now is some sleep.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mmr_03_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"ether","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mmr_03_36","text":"Yeah?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mmr_03_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"ether","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mmr_03_37","text":"Hmm, maybe I should do the same.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mmr_03_38","type":"Speech","speaker":"ether","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mmr_03_38","text":"I'm too lazy to choose what to eat.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mmr_03_39","type":"Speech","speaker":"ether","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mmr_03_39","text":"What do you think we should do, No. 7?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mmr_03_40","type":"Speech","speaker":"mana","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mmr_03_40","text":"Ether, for goodness sake.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mmr_03_41","type":"Speech","speaker":"mana","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mmr_03_41","text":"Surely you can make that decision on your own?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mmr_03_42","type":"Speech","speaker":"ether","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mmr_03_42","text":"Nah, too lazy. Don't feel like choosing.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mmr_03_43","type":"Speech","speaker":"mana","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mmr_03_43","text":"Then just sleep.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mmr_03_44","type":"Speech","speaker":"ether","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mmr_03_44","text":"Okie dokie :)","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mmr_03_45","type":"Speech","speaker":"ether","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mmr_03_45","text":"Good night everyone.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mmr_03_46","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mmr_03_46","text":"Good night.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mmr_03_47","type":"Speech","speaker":"mana","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mmr_03_47","text":"Sorry about that, Commander.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mmr_03_48","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mmr_03_48","text":"You should hurry to bed too, Mana.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mmr_03_49","type":"Speech","speaker":"mana","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mmr_03_49","text":"Yes, I'll go get some rest as well.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mmr_03_50","type":"Speech","speaker":"mana","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mmr_03_50","text":"You should follow suit, Commander.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mmr_03_51","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mmr_03_51","text":"I will. Now go rest up, you've earned it.","jump":null}],"chat":true}